@startuml Digi Bank - Validation Pipeline
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam linetype ortho
title Digi Bank\nBuild and Validation Pipeline

start
:Checkout repository;
:Maven compile and unit tests;
:Build Docker images;
:Start Docker Compose stack;
:Validate all expected containers;
:Run gateway and service smoke checks;
:Run Newman API validation;
:Run OWASP ZAP baseline scan;
:Upload Newman and ZAP reports;
stop

note right
  Newman: 74/74 assertions passed locally.
  ZAP: 0 failures, baseline warnings only.
end note
@enduml
